# UI Guidelines

## Colors & Theme

Green palette defined in `src/styles.css` (oklch). Use utility classes:
- `gradient-primary text-primary-foreground` — primary buttons
- `text-muted-foreground` — secondary text
- `border-destructive/40 bg-destructive/10` — errors

Font: **Plus Jakarta Sans**. Do not change without request.

## Layout

```tsx
// Standard page
<div className="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl space-y-6 overflow-x-hidden p-4 sm:p-6">

// Form page
<div className="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 p-6">
```

## Components

Use shadcn/ui from `src/components/ui/`. Never duplicate Button, Card, Dialog, etc.

- Primary actions: `Button size="lg" className="gradient-primary text-primary-foreground"`
- Content sections: `Card` + `CardHeader` + `CardContent`
- Confirmations: `AlertDialog`
- Forms: `Label` + `Input` / `Select` / `Textarea`

Icons: lucide-react, always paired with text labels.

## Required States

Every feature must handle:
- **Loading** — `Loader2 animate-spin` + Vietnamese text
- **Error** — red border/background + retry button
- **Empty** — dashed border, title, description, CTA
- **Success** — `toast.success()` via sonner

## Language

All UI text in **Vietnamese**. Use `vi-VN` for dates/numbers. Friendly tone for farmers.

See `docs/ui-guideline.md` for full standards.
